  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "eyebrow",
      "text": "problem"
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "html": "Users were publishing the menu."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "According to the company metrics, on average <mark>10% of new users who start the onboarding process publish their QR menu</mark>."
    },
    {
      "type": "eyebrow",
      "text": "Solution"
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "html": "A simple onboarding process, that automates menu publishing."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Redesigning onboarding to focus on <mark>intuitive menu customization</mark>, allowing users to <mark>publish a menu upon signup</mark>."
    },
    {
      "type": "button",
      "label": "View Final Designs",
      "href": "#solution"
    },
    {
      "type": "label",
      "text": "Impact"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "Went <mark>live December 2021</mark>",
        "<mark>30% increase</mark> in the percentage of new users who publish a menu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "label",
      "text": "Toolkit"
    },
    {
      "type": "chips",
      "items": [
        "Adobe XD"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "research",
      "label": "Research"
    },
    {
      "type": "eyebrow",
      "text": "Heuristic evaluation"
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "html": "Evaluating old components."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "I started by <mark>analyzing the current onboarding process</mark>, loosely following Nielsen's ten design principles to identify any usability issues."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6753cd4e812cbecd7d5d52d9/678eb5e5717aed6369bfd08e_Group%20868.png",
        "width": 846,
        "height": 591
      },
      "caption": "Previous onboarding process"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Some of the <mark>issues</mark> I found were:"
    },
    {
      "type": "gallery",
      "images": [
        {
          "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6753cd4e812cbecd7d5d52d9/67903ae6c4fbef03df7e1088_Frame%2051139.png",
          "width": 845,
          "height": 492
        },
        {
          "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6753cd4e812cbecd7d5d52d9/67903ae6698624426c2cabfb_Frame%2051140.png",
          "width": 845,
          "height": 492
        },
        {
          "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6753cd4e812cbecd7d5d52d9/67903ae61d835ce5dd50eae2_Frame%2051141.png",
          "width": 845,
          "height": 492
        },
        {
          "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6753cd4e812cbecd7d5d52d9/67903ae6ccae562461769101_Frame%2051142.png",
          "width": 845,
          "height": 492
        },
        {
          "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6753cd4e812cbecd7d5d52d9/67903ae624d6a6cd571a2afb_Frame%2051143.png",
          "width": 845,
          "height": 492
        },
        {
          "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6753cd4e812cbecd7d5d52d9/67903ae6f6345c6fd1749bfb_Frame%201321318618.png",
          "width": 845,
          "height": 492
        }
      ],
      "caption": "Usability issues found"
    },
    {
      "type": "eyebrow",
      "text": "Interview"
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "html": "I interviewed the head of marketing."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Since no clients were available for interviews, <mark>I interviewed the head of marketing</mark>, who brought most customers through direct advertising, and helped them with creating accounts/onboarding. The interview was <mark>semi-structured.</mark>"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "html": "Interview Insights"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullets",
      "items": [
        "Users were <mark>hesitant to sign up</mark> before beginning the onboarding process",
        "There were <mark>bugs</mark> that interrupted the onboarding process",
        "<mark>Users were confused</mark> since they could not see the menu",
        "Most users are <mark>males 45+</mark>, with <mark>little to no experience with web design platforms</mark>",
        "Users had <mark>difficulties navigating the platform</mark> after onboarding"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "eyebrow",
      "text": "Competitive analysis"
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "html": "What were other platforms doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "I decided to perform a competitive analysis of the onboarding processes in <mark>2 different design platforms:</mark>"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "<mark>Wix</mark> - one of the world's leading web design services, targeting users with little to no web design experience.",
        "<mark>Online Menus</mark> - a QR menu design platform which targets business owners."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6753cd4e812cbecd7d5d52d9/6792c3c13945c7011c7a3b5b_Group%201000004563.png",
        "width": 846,
        "height": 759
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "define",
      "label": "Define"
    },
    {
      "type": "eyebrow",
      "text": "Challenge"
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "html": "How can we improve the onboarding experience to increase the percentage of new users who publish a menu?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "html": "I ideated solutions for each pain point."
    },
    {
      "type": "pairs",
      "items": [
        {
          "problem": "No business type consideration",
          "solution": "Provide more business types"
        },
        {
          "problem": "No progress visibility",
          "solution": "Progress bar"
        },
        {
          "problem": "UI inconsistencies",
          "solution": "Consistent buttons and screens"
        },
        {
          "problem": "No menu visible/no customization",
          "solution": "Add a menu visual, with basic customization options"
        },
        {
          "problem": "Insufficient guidance/misleading CTAs",
          "solution": "Clear directions with accurate CTAs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "eyebrow",
      "text": "User persona"
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "html": "Meet Anthony."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Based on my research, <mark>I developed a user persona that demonstrates QR Menu's target clients'</mark> goals and pain points when it comes to the onboarding process."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6753cd4e812cbecd7d5d52d9/6792c5373c90b891afec10c9_66e786df0dcb8cb0f11dda53_Group%20866.png",
        "width": 846,
        "height": 668
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "ideation-iterations",
      "label": "Ideation + Iterations"
    },
    {
      "type": "eyebrow",
      "text": "Business goals consideration"
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "html": "How can I drastically increase publishing rates?"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "I realized that we could <mark>increase menu publishing rates</mark> by letting new users publish a menu as a step at the end of the onboarding process and moving the signup to the end. Thus, we identified two more opportunity areas:"
    },
    {
      "type": "bullets",
      "items": [
        "<mark>Move sign-up to the end</mark>",
        "<mark>Publish automatically with sign-up</mark>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "Additional opportunity areas"
    },
    {
      "type": "eyebrow",
      "text": "Business goals consideration"
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "html": "I mapped out the user flow."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Users can customize their business type, menu language, theme, logo, banner, font combination, menu categories, items, and social media links. A signup button at the end prompts account creation, <mark>automatically publishing their menu.</mark>"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6753cd4e812cbecd7d5d52d9/6792caa594298bf3a28763a4_f66ce6_75206787cb0d4b1d9cb63c3f9859df95~mv2.avif",
        "width": 1526,
        "height": 1316
      },
      "caption": "Onboarding process user flow"
    },
    {
      "type": "eyebrow",
      "text": "Wireframes"
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "html": "It started from a rough sketch."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "After getting feedback from the PM regarding the user flow, I created a few <mark>wireframes</mark> that show the vision I had for the layout of the onboarding process."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6753cd4e812cbecd7d5d52d9/6792cd917a073944fa41ee69_66e793bccfe54a76d86b5b40_f66ce6_a20ffc8e2511429dbd2874b54a74571e~mv2.webp",
        "width": 846,
        "height": 503
      },
      "caption": "Early wireframes"
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "solution",
      "label": "Solution"
    },
    {
      "type": "eyebrow",
      "text": "Final Designs"
    },
    {
      "type": "title",
      "html": "6 big improvements!"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "html": "1. <strong>I provided </strong><mark><strong>more business types</strong></mark><strong>.</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "I added additional business types as well as an \"Other\" option, since QR menu has different menu templates depending on the business type."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6753cd4e812cbecd7d5d52d9/6792d12d4afd721aa1c99d53_66e79d75548b48ebd8965c58_f66ce6_3e5461d76afe4dedb15b1a38a71ea880~mv2.gif",
        "width": 1920,
        "height": 1080
      },
      "caption": "Business types screen"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "html": "2. <strong>I added a </strong><mark><strong>progress bar</strong></mark><strong>.</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "I grouped the onboarding process into 4 steps, and chose a linear indicator with levels to add progress visibility."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6753cd4e812cbecd7d5d52d9/6792d1f9649835e295fb86ea_66e7b95d71260e5c9c1532b9_f66ce6_86ed23ad2aa04838bedc1907a5826bc4~mv2.gif",
        "width": 1690,
        "height": 271
      },
      "caption": "Progress bar"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "html": "3. <strong>I added a </strong><mark><strong>consistent buttons &amp; screens</strong></mark><strong>.</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "I established a design system with consistent buttons, spacing, and typography. I also made sure to keep all of the screens in a similar format to avoid confusion and added a \"Back\" button."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6753cd4e812cbecd7d5d52d9/6792d27d4f1e2ec12c7efb00_66e7b9bb1e86526d25d7387f_f66ce6_4c4a4ceb548647dd918e2029e77349b9~mv2.webp",
        "width": 845,
        "height": 313
      },
      "caption": "spacing & buttons"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "html": "4. <strong>I added a </strong><mark><strong>menu visual &amp; basic customization</strong></mark><strong>.</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "I added a clickable real-time menu preview and basic customization options for themes, categories, and items, turning the onboarding process into an interactive platform demo."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6753cd4e812cbecd7d5d52d9/6792d33818c9d0e4fa709a20_66e7baef9227d119773c0e6b_f66ce6_7ac3d9d131874d5e93d29036d53093d5~mv2.gif",
        "width": 1920,
        "height": 1080
      },
      "caption": "Customization Screen"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "html": "5. <strong>I added </strong><mark><strong>clear directions and accurate CTAs</strong></mark><strong>.</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "I added clear CTAs, which made the onboarding process intuitive and easy to complete and made sure to consider error handling and make actions reversible. I changed the terminology from \"products\" to \"menu items.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/f66ce6_18e51f9ad5db45e69f39722106a743cc~mv2.gif",
        "width": 1920,
        "height": 1080
      },
      "caption": "Menu items screen"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "html": "6. <strong>I made the menu </strong><mark><strong>publish automatically</strong></mark><strong> upon signup.</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "I made the sign-up process the last step. This allowed users to get a taste of the platform without creating an account and made onboarding more transparent and less time-consuming. Once users reach the sign-up, they already have an initial draft of their menu, which goes live automatically once they create an account/log in."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "image": {
        "src": "https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6753cd4e812cbecd7d5d52d9/6792d5a9f0792cacf3e6a016_66e7bbfcaba0aced2defc521_qr%20menu%20log%20in.webp",
        "width": 846,
        "height": 476
      },
      "caption": "sign up screen"
    },
    {
      "type": "eyebrow",
      "text": "High Fidelity Prototype"
    },
    {
